    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Chloe buys $x$ kg of bananas for $\\$3$ a kilogram, and $x$ kg of apples for $\\$2$ a kilogram. The total cost is $\\$15.50$. Find the value of $x$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=3.1$; Chloe buys $3.1$ kg of each fruit.",
      "worked": "The bananas cost $\\$3x$ and the apples cost $\\$2x$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}3x+2x&=15.50\\\\5x&=15.50\\\\x&=\\frac{15.50}{5}\\\\x&=3.1\\end{align*}$$\n\nChloe buys $3.1$ kg of bananas and $3.1$ kg of apples.",
